{
  "//": "Test/tsx config for the agent-processes workers owner. The session-opened payload builder reaches `yaml` through the backend session-metadata → subagent-profiles chain, whose dependency is installed only under application/hosts/vscode; these paths alias tsx at that same copy. Typecheck uses tsconfig.release.json.",
